        "nobel_worthiness": "Atom interferometry made quantum coherence into a broadly useful instrument for gravimetry, inertial sensing, metrology, and tests of fundamental physics.",
        "attribution": "Bordé provided key conceptual foundations, and Kasevich and Pritchard made landmark experimental contributions.",
        "maturity": "The methods have been replicated widely and have developed into robust precision-measurement technologies.",
